{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/a49631dd2dad0a4edc3a15cbea494ded.webp?t=1768771489\" width=463 height=26 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, trap, and re-home your growing collection of Creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore and manage your Zoo to delight visitors and balance your Cryptid needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items, farm food, and gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match: Breed Hybrid Cryptids in your zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/7544eb54c17b4c9602ee77cb48242f3b.avif?t=1768771489\" width=1560 height=325 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cryptid Keeper</strong> is a cozy creature-collecting and management adventure about a man and his cat. Tired of everyday life, they quit it all and buy a run-down old zoo in dire need of restoration on the edge of the <strong>Great Fractured Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a fresh start quickly becomes something more, taking you on a journey to hunt strange creatures in the wild, restore your Cryptid Zoo, and exhibit your creatures in the zoo enclosures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.webm?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.mp4?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the large world map to track down strange Cryptids and Alien beings. Use your radar scanner, traps, bait and smart strategy to capture your creatures in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a days hunt, bring your Cryptids home, restore your Cryptid Zoo to bring it back to life. Care for your captured creatures, maintain their enclosures, feed and water them, and attract curious visitors who are inclined to pay a higher price as your collection grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.webm?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.mp4?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather natural resources: Grimberries, Duskleaf and Shadowvines to craft food, gear and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade or sell unwanted creatures, shape your zoo your way.\u00a0Breed two Cryptids in the Breeding Enclosure to produce Hybrid Cryptid Eggs and discover entirely new customised creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/8085b6b9a5f22aac384bafc0f5c96852.webp?t=1768771489\" width=463 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.webm?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.mp4?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667060?t=1768771489","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/dc08a6027cb9ed641743cb790420b94a8c150f68/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768771489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/88d6cdc6152dcb91a8a42e1cdd4dcd6053ad32a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768771489","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/88d6cdc6152dcb91a8a42e1cdd4dcd6053ad32a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768771489","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/a49631dd2dad0a4edc3a15cbea494ded.webp?t=1768771489\" width=463 height=26 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, trap, and re-home your growing collection of Creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore and manage your Zoo to delight visitors and balance your Cryptid needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items, farm food, and gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match: Breed Hybrid Cryptids in your zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/7544eb54c17b4c9602ee77cb48242f3b.avif?t=1768771489\" width=1560 height=325 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cryptid Keeper</strong> is a cozy creature-collecting and management adventure about a man and his cat. Tired of everyday life, they quit it all and buy a run-down old zoo in dire need of restoration on the edge of the <strong>Great Fractured Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a fresh start quickly becomes something more, taking you on a journey to hunt strange creatures in the wild, restore your Cryptid Zoo, and exhibit your creatures in the zoo enclosures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.webm?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.mp4?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the large world map to track down strange Cryptids and Alien beings. Use your radar scanner, traps, bait and smart strategy to capture your creatures in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a days hunt, bring your Cryptids home, restore your Cryptid Zoo to bring it back to life. Care for your captured creatures, maintain their enclosures, feed and water them, and attract curious visitors who are inclined to pay a higher price as your collection grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.webm?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.mp4?t=1768771489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather natural resources: Grimberries, Duskleaf and Shadowvines to craft food, gear and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade or sell unwanted creatures, shape your zoo your way.\u00a0Breed two Cryptids in the Breeding Enclosure to produce Hybrid Cryptid Eggs and discover entirely new customised creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/8085b6b9a5f22aac384bafc0f5c96852.webp?t=1768771489\" width=463 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.poster.avif?t=1768771489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:/